# Stable spec ID: punch-left-hand. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(bourbon) 1 1/2 oz
(bitter aperitif @ Campari) 3/4 oz
(vermouth; sweet red @ ~Carpano Antica Formula) 3/4 oz
(bitters; mole) 2 dashes

::equipment
(mixing glass)
(serving vessel) = (coupe) -OR- (cocktail glass)

::instructions
<stir, measured ingredients with ice in (mixing glass)>
<strain, into a chilled (serving vessel)>
<garnish, with a cherry>

